Spartan Weaponry (NeoForge 26.1 port)

This module is a derived work of Spartan Weaponry 3.2.1 by ObliviousSpartan
(https://github.com/ObliviousSpartan/SpartanWeaponry, commit e45342c, branch 1.20.1),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Taken from upstream: item textures, base item models, weapon statistics (damage, speed,
reach and sweep values) and crafting patterns. Art credit from upstream: xwerffx for the
weapon ideas and most of the art; translators alexvirgo13 (Spanish), Samlegamer (French),
MrMikeForDev (Chinese), SplashedTomato (Russian).

Changed: the code is a new, much smaller implementation for Minecraft 26.1.2 and NeoForge
(data components and attributes instead of the original item classes and trait registry);
the generator in tools/gen.py rebuilds the data from the upstream checkout; item names are
in Diaithiris; the metal set is reduced to wood, stone, copper, bronze and iron.
